{"result":"{
  "id": "17905",
  "key": "SFCC-55",
  "summary": "Global Footer UI",
  "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/17905",
  "description": "**As a** Shopper, \n**I want** to see a consistent global footer on every page, \n**so that** I can access navigation links, contact information, legal content, and newsletter sign-up from anywhere on the site.\n\nReference image (Figma is leading):\n\n![\"image-20260618-041717.png\"](image-20260618-041717.png)\n\n----\n\nThe global footer is displayed at the bottom of every page across all storefronts and devices. It is CMS-managed via Contentful, allowing business users to update footer links and copy without a code deployment. The content of the footer (e.g. links) can be configured per storefront. Contentful integration is covered in a separate user story. This story covers the **footer shell, layout, and component structure only** — footer link destinations, email sign-up Omneo integration, and Cookie Settings behaviour are covered in separate stories.\nLinks like “ACKNOWLEDGEMENT OF COUNTRY” are only relevant on the AU storefront, however, for the purpose of this user story we can include whatever placeholder links we want and can use the design as a first set of links.\n\n**Responsive behaviour:** There is a footer design for both desktop and mobile.",
  "status": {
    "name": "Blocked",
    "category": "In Progress",
    "color": "yellow"
  },
  "issue_type": {
    "name": "Story"
  },
  "priority": {
    "name": "Medium"
  },
  "assignee": {
    "display_name": "Marcel Angelo Navarro",
    "name": "Marcel Angelo Navarro",
    "email": "marcel.a.n.navarro@accenture.com",
    "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/482e2e100517026f4980d6455214aa11?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FMN-6.png"
  },
  "reporter": {
    "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
    "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
    "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
    "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
  },
  "labels": [
    "DesignDependent",
    "HPC-030",
    "HPC-031",
    "HPC-032",
    "HPC-033",
    "HPC-034",
    "HPC-035",
    "HPC-037",
    "HPC-038",
    "Squad-A"
  ],
  "created": "2026-06-18T14:16:13.564+1000",
  "updated": "2026-07-28T10:35:50.819+1000",
  "comments": [
    {
      "id": "13355",
      "body": "Rebecca signs of the user story but Dani still needs to sign off the design next week",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-07-02T12:17:12.368+1000",
      "updated": "2026-07-02T12:17:12.368+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13370",
      "body": "Today we signed off with Dani & Vicky: alignment of copyright + seeing the behavior of email sign up. \n\nbut still pending: rollover state & text updates (like what goes into what category and the language checking with CRM).",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-07-07T15:35:53.087+1000",
      "updated": "2026-07-07T15:35:53.087+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13375",
      "body": "User:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac User:712020:a070aeb5-3811-46ca-b323-e2272f4cd929 Design team updated also rollover state in the footer - to make sure it’s tested I added 1 acceptance criteria because it was only listed as an open item - not as AC, so want to make sure we build and test it: \n\nGiven a shopper hovers over one of the navigation links, the rollover state will be that that word or those words are underlined.",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
