  "summary": "PDP UI — Size Selector & Add to Bag",
  "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/18130",
  "description": "**As a** Shopper,\n**I want** to select my size and add a product to my bag directly from the PDP,\n**so that** I can quickly purchase the item I want in the right size.\n\n----\n\nImage for reference (figma leading): \n\n\n![\"image-20260701-120944.png\"](image-20260701-120944.png)\n\n\nThis story covers the size selector component on the PDP and the Add to Bag CTA. Size availability is derived from inventory levels - integration not in this user story - we can configure some inventory in the test environment. The Add to Bag cart integration is out of scope; this story covers the display and enabled/disabled state of the CTA based on size selection and stock availability. Find in Boutique and Notify Me slide-out are separate stories.",
