      "updated": "2026-07-07T15:27:18.788+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13402",
      "body": "User:712020:c99d37b3-9c93-4347-951d-5ffb32ff1341 I have split out the Coming Soon / Unavailable (all sizes) states as a separate user story and notified Charmaine to work on that design. This story for the ‘base version’ of the size selector is now ready for your review.",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-07-14T12:13:07.798+1000",
      "updated": "2026-07-14T12:13:07.798+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13528",
      "body": "Hey User:557058:a8d3e24a-618f-49c2-a524-9f82f1ad6b1b / User:557058:09af9e5b-661b-42a2-90ec-9ce9f69d324d - Do you mind helping User:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d  out with this question?",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Tim Lavelle",
        "name": "Tim Lavelle",
        "email": "timothy.lavelle@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/557058:1a7fb05a-783b-4241-a0f1-9a7b046da3a8/69afd82c-3275-4f1a-82c5-96388b537351/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-07-26T08:27:29.041+1000",
      "updated": "2026-07-26T08:27:29.041+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13529",
      "body": "Hey User:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d, just continuing on with my UI story reviews 🙂 My view is that the Size Selector and Add to Bag should be different components and user stories because some items won’t have a size selector, so we don’t want to tie these two items together. The Add to Bag component will have some validation rules configured likely in SFCC and the codebase on when it is available to be clicked on. User:557058:a8d3e24a-618f-49c2-a524-9f82f1ad6b1b  / User:557058:09af9e5b-661b-42a2-90ec-9ce9f69d324d - Can you help shed some light on this?\n\nI won’t go through the A/Cs individually given I think it’s best we split these out. \n\nThanks Jas!",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Tim Lavelle",
        "name": "Tim Lavelle",
        "email": "timothy.lavelle@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/557058:1a7fb05a-783b-4241-a0f1-9a7b046da3a8/69afd82c-3275-4f1a-82c5-96388b537351/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-07-26T08:30:25.436+1000",
      "updated": "2026-07-26T08:31:04.324+1000"
    }
  ]
}"}

