{"result":"{
  "id": "18110",
  "key": "SFCC-89",
  "summary": "PDP UI — Static Product Information",
  "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/18110",
  "description": "**As a** Shopper,\n**I want** to see clear product information when I land on a product detail page,\n**so that** I can quickly understand what the product is before deciding to buy.\n\n----\n\nThis story covers the rendering of static product information on the PDP — fields sourced directly from the SFCC product record. It has no dependency on the Contentful integration, the colour/variation model, or inventory data. It is the most foundational PDP story and should be built first.\n\nReference image (Figma is leading): see attachment.\n\n![\"image-20260716-035621.png\"](image-20260716-035621.png)\n\n**In Scope:**\n\n- Badges\n- Product name\n- Full price in the currency of the active storefront (single/full price only)\n- Product description\n- \"Model is…\" copy — model height and size worn\n- Style Code\n- Breadcrumb navigation reflecting the product's category path (bottom of PDP)\n\n**Out of scope (separate stories):**\n\n- Was/Now sale price display\n- Wishlist icon (CTAs story)\n- Colour swatches and variation selection\n- Size selector and availability states\n- Add to Bag, Find in Boutique CTAs\n- Image gallery\n- Accordion content (Details & Care, Size & Fit, Shipping & Returns)\n- Contentful-sourced content",
  "status": {
    "name": "Blocked",
    "category": "In Progress",
    "color": "yellow"
  },
  "issue_type": {
    "name": "Story"
  },
  "priority": {
