{"result":"{
  "id": "18069",
  "key": "SFCC-83",
  "summary": "Recently Viewed UI Component (Shared)",
  "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/18069",
  "description": "**As a** Shopper, \n**I want** to see a list of products I've recently browsed,\n**so that** I can easily return to items I was considering without having to search for them again.\n\nReference image (Figma is leading):\n\n![\"image-20260703-004122.png\"](image-20260703-004122.png)\n\n----\n\nRecently Viewed is a shared PWA component that renders a horizontal rail of product tiles based on the customer's browsing history. It is built once and reused across multiple page contexts. Confirmed surfaces are PLP, PDP, and Cart. Additional surfaces are pending the designs.\n\n**Browsing history storage:**\n\n  - For **guest shoppers*: history is stored temporarily. It persists for the duration of that session only.\n  - For **authenticated shoppers*: history persisted cross-session — stored against the customer account so it survives browser close and is available on login from any device.",
  "status": {
    "name": "Blocked",
    "category": "In Progress",
    "color": "yellow"
  },
  "issue_type": {
    "name": "Story"
  },
  "priority": {
    "name": "Medium"
  },
  "assignee": {
    "display_name": "Marcel Angelo Navarro",
    "name": "Marcel Angelo Navarro",
    "email": "marcel.a.n.navarro@accenture.com",
    "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/482e2e100517026f4980d6455214aa11?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FMN-6.png"
  },
  "reporter": {
    "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
    "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
    "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
    "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
  },
  "labels": [
    "Custom",
    "DesignDependent",
    "PRD-027",
    "SPR-61"
  ],
  "created": "2026-06-22T16:10:17.809+1000",
  "updated": "2026-07-28T10:36:00.884+1000",
  "comments": [
    {
      "id": "13356",
      "body": "To discuss about consent -\n\n- Is consent for Recently Viewed for both guest and authenticated users - what if shopper rejected consent - then logs in\n- Need a separate user story for consent (how long to store this data from a customer)",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-07-03T10:50:12.341+1000",
      "updated": "2026-07-03T10:52:23.979+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13358",
      "body": "Sent email to Vicky to check if Recently Viewed is consent-gated. \n\nAfter testing the AU and EU domestic sites I found that after rejecting all cookies, my recently viewed products were still tracked. This component might be just part of the required cookies.",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-07-03T17:06:26.497+1000",
      "updated": "2026-07-03T17:06:26.497+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13403",
      "body": "Removed consent requirements into [SFCC-106](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-106) and discussed in user story review today with Emma and Rebecca.",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-07-14T12:24:30.624+1000",
      "updated": "2026-07-14T12:24:30.624+1000"
    }
  ]
}"}

